<title>UK: WOLTERS KLUWER SETS 400 MLN DFL BOND.</title>
<headline>WOLTERS KLUWER SETS 400 MLN DFL BOND.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by</p>
<p>lead manager ING Barings.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WOLTERS KLUWER NV					     </p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DFL   COUPON     5.875     MATURITY    04.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.425   PAY DATE    04.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.90     SPREAD	+56.4 BP </p>
<p> LISTING    AMST	DENOMS (K) 5-50-1M   SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES	</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.35	SELL CONC  1.525     TAX PROVS   DOMESTIC </p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.50 PCT APRIL 2003 DSL			 </p>
<p> NOTES	+40 BP OVER INTERPOLATED APR 2003 AND JAN 2004 DSLS</p>
<p>		SUBORDINATED ISSUE					    </p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
